OpenNOW Boosteroid provider

This project adapts Boosteroid service-protocol knowledge and implementation
from OpenStroid, https://github.com/OpenCloudGaming/OpenStroid, at commit
c27c4f54974bf2d0a58c625c3f219dcb05bd0fd2, licensed under Apache-2.0.
The native Rust port replaces OpenStroid's browser/Electron runtime and player
with OpenNOW provider and encoded-media worker interfaces. It is not the
official Boosteroid client and contains no proprietary client binaries.

The OpenNOW provider SDK is distributed under the MIT license. Its notices and
the licenses of the final dependency set must accompany distributed packages.
